{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把“想在难受时有人陪”进一步解释成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比X更替人物下判断，少了一些必要的留白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段真正推进故事的关键意思凸显出来，话与感受交替，感受又按音乐进程适时出现，观众更容易在听音乐时抓住叙事重点和情绪转折。它对声音、身体反应、心理变化的描写也更具体细腻，能看出情绪如何发生、变化和消退。X的主要问题是右侧感受词虽然丰富，但并列堆放较多，缺少先后层次，观众不容易判断哪些是核心感受、哪些是瞬间变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8f2e8aaa-2c36-41d0-94b9-d09407d9c98a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210143025258Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:02:34.862797+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aa17391397d092a7f27070b9daecf0cae161bbe6d69d6d86ac69caa6e4dcfe5f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.p